* Cascode bias + P/N cascode source/sink testbench (from tb_Cascode_Bias).
* DUT: .subckt dut iin out vb1 vb2 vb3 vb4. 'out' is held by VO and swept 0..VDD;
* i(VO) is the PMOS-source minus NMOS-sink current mismatch.
$HEADER
.param VDD=$VDD Iref=$IREF
.global vdd
.options reltol=1e-3 gmin=1e-12 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12
.temp 27

$DUT

VSUP vdd 0 dc {VDD}
IREF vdd nin dc {Iref}
VO nout 0 dc 0.9
XDUT nin nout vb1 vb2 vb3 vb4 dut

.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
option numdgt=7
op
print all > op_nodes.txt
$OPPRINT
dc VO 0 $VDD 0.01
wrdata dc_sweep.txt i(VO)
.endc
.end
